sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant J as httpjet<br/>acme manager
  participant S as PrivateStore
  participant D as DNS controller<br/>(operator webhook, Bearer auth)
  participant CA as ACME CA
  J->>S: journal cleanup intent {name, value} BEFORE any DNS change
  J->>D: POST {"version":1,"operation":"present","name":"_acme-challenge.example.test","value":"<43-char digest>"}
  D-->>J: {"ok":true}
  loop bounded polling
    J->>D: POST operation "ready"
    D-->>J: {"ok":true,"ready":false|true}
  end
  J->>CA: ready → finalize → poll (inside the 120 s attempt)
  CA-->>J: certificate (apex and/or *.zone — one leftmost label)
  J->>D: POST operation "cleanup" (removes only that value — idempotent)
  D-->>J: {"ok":true}
  J->>S: clear journal entry, commit certificate snapshot
  Note over J,D: a failed cleanup keeps the journal entry: new issuance blocks until replayed (also at startup and shutdown)
